Mfinal = αdense · Mdense + αsparse · Msparse. (10)
The coefficient Mfinal is used to sample a discrete communication topology G that determines how messages flow between agents during inference, following the Bernoulli edge sampling strategy proposed inZhang et al.(2025a).
